## Beyond Jest: Maestro E2E

Jest covers logic and screens in isolation. Flows across real native code (sign-in,
deep links, permissions, the keyboard) are Maestro flows in `.maestro/*.yaml`, run with
`make e2e APP_ID=<bundle id>` against a development or preview build. Select by
`testID` (`id:`), never by translated text. See the mobile-tester agent for the flow format.
